{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ce5ebea8-b4fb-8b15-b814-4d8f5ce60291",
  "created_at": "2026-01-08T13:40:09-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Peter Lawton",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:35:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:35:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, yes, hi. Peter Lawton. Sure, thanks for picking up. I'm calling because our trash wasn't picked up this week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:35:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sorry to hear that. What's your normal pickup day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:35:52-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tuesday. Usually it's Tuesday, absolutely, and I had the barrel out at the curb by seven in the morning. It's still sitting there. Still full."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:36:06-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha. So Tuesday, barrel out early, not collected. And it's Thursday afternoon now, so that's two days. Let me jot that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:36:18-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, yes, exactly. Sorry, hold on, I'm at a crosswalk. [pause] Okay, a truck's going by, so if I get loud that's why."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:36:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. Be careful out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:36:37-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, of course. Okay. So, nobody left a tag on it or anything, no sticker, nothing like that. [inaudible] Sorry, a bus. Nothing on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:36:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, no tag. Did your neighbors get picked up, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:36:59-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, yeah, I think so. The ones on both sides had their barrels back up by the garage Tuesday night. Ours is the only one still out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:37:14-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. So the street seems to have been done and yours got skipped. That happens sometimes, a truck gets rerouted or a driver misses one. What's the address there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:37:30-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, um, I'd rather not give the address on this call, if that's okay. Is that okay? I can leave my number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:37:42-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, that's fine. Without the address I can't put in a pickup request on my end, but I can take a note for a supervisor and they can get the address from you when they call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:38:02-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, that works. That's actually what I wanted. Could I get a supervisor to call me back? Sure, I'd just like to talk to somebody who can say when it's getting picked up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:38:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, I'll flag it. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:38:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one five oh."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:38:31-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one five oh. Peter Lawton, is that L-A-W-T-O-N?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:38:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's it, exactly, L-A-W-T-O-N. Perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:38:44-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. So I've got missed trash pickup Tuesday, barrel out by seven, no tag, neighbors collected, wants a supervisor callback. Anything else I should put?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:38:58-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, that's everything. Oh, well, if it's a recycling day thing, we didn't put recycling out, just the trash. Just so they know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:39:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, trash only. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:39:15-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, thanks. And when should I expect the call, roughly? Today, or, you know, whenever?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:39:24-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Probably later today or tomorrow morning. I can't promise the hour, but I'll get it to them right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:39:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, that's fine. Should I just leave the barrel out in the meantime?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:39:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, leave it at the curb for now. If the supervisor says different, they'll tell you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:39:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. Okay. Light's changing, so I'm going to go. Thanks, Kevin, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:40:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, Peter. Have a good one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:40:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
